{"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSTextArea"}],"symbolKind":"struct","platforms":[{"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","name":"iOS","unavailable":false},{"name":"iPadOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"beta":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","name":"Mac Catalyst","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false},{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","beta":false,"name":"macOS","deprecated":false},{"beta":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","name":"visionOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false}],"roleHeading":"Structure","externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents12OUDSTextAreaV","title":"OUDSTextArea","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSTextArea"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Components"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSTextArea","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Controls"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Layout","text":"Layout"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Text area is based on several configurable UI elements:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"label"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": It is used to describe the purpose of the text area.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In some UI contexts, especially when space is limited or when the text area is part of a compact layout, the label can be hidden."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However, hiding the label should only be done if the purpose remains clear thanks to a placeholder or contextual icon"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and if the label is still accessible to screen readers."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Hiding a label is a design choice that must balance visual simplicity and clarity of intent, without compromising inclusiveness or form guidance."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"placeholder"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": If the text of the text area is empty a placeholder provides a hint or guidance inside the field to suggest expected input.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"text":"Status","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Status"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Five status are proposed for all layouts:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"enabled (by default)"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Default neutral appearance, whether empty or filled."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It allows users to click, focus, and type freely without restrictions."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"error","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": The ","type":"text"},{"code":"error","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" status (","type":"text"},{"code":"textualError(message:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") indicates that the user input does not meet validation rules or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"expected formatting. It provides immediate visual feedback, typically through a red border,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an error icon, and a clear, accessible error message positioned below the text area. The error message replaces the helper text."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"loading"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": The ","type":"text"},{"code":"loading","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" state indicates that the system is processing or retrieving data","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"related to the text entered. A progress indicator appears to inform the user that an action is in progress.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The field remains editable while loading.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"readOnly","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": The ","type":"text"},{"code":"readOnly","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" status lets the text visible but not editable.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"disabled"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": In ","type":"text"},{"code":"disabled","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" status, the field is non-interactive and grayed out to indicate it cannot be changed.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Note the SwiftUI ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View.disabled()"},{"type":"text","text":" is ignored."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"text":"Helpers","anchor":"Helpers","type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Helper text (plain)"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": A supporting text conveys additional information about the text area,"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"such as how it will be used. It should ideally only take up a single line, though may wrap","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to multiple lines if required, and be either persistently visible or visible only on focus.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Helper text (characters max count)","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Uses an internal message displaying the count of remaining characters depending to the given value."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is a specific iOS library feature with 1.4.0"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Helper link"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": If the helper text is not sufficient, it’s possible to offer the user","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"an additional help link (the link can be external or open a modal).","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"heading","text":"Accessibility considerations","level":2,"anchor":"Accessibility-considerations"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"By default no haptics are done by the component.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"However you should think about cases where you will have to make the devices vibrate.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"You can refer to the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/developer.apple.com\/design\/human-interface-guidelines\/playing-haptics"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Mandatory field indication","level":2,"anchor":"Mandatory-field-indication"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If all fields are mandatory (several fields present): display the message “All fields are mandatory” at the top of your form."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Do not use an asterisk at the end of each field label, nor the word “mandatory.”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If not all fields are mandatory (several fields present): display the message “All fields marked with an * are mandatory” at the top of your form.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Use an asterisk (*) at the end of each mandatory field label, and ensures this is well vocalized.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"UI rendering of the asterisk must be done with "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"bold font weight","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"negative content color"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (red on light backgrounds)."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Use the mention “(optional)” at the end of each optional field label. Note that this rule is not systematic, it remains an option, to be used if needed.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If there is only one field in the form, or if the mandatory nature is obvious,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no mention is necessary since the fields are essential to the form’s functionality."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Outlined-style","level":2,"text":"Outlined style"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"By "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"default","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", the text area uses a subtle background fill and a bottom border only, creating a softer and more contained look."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"outlined"}]},{"type":"text","text":", the text area uses a transparent background and a visible stroke on all four sides."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This style may be appropriate for contexts where inputs need to feel lightweight and unobtrusive,","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for example inside a card, a dialog, or a filtering panel."}]},{"code":["    \/\/ An outlined text area","    OUDSTextArea(label: \"Comments\", text: $text, isOutlined: true)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"Fixed-height","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Fixed height"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"By "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"default","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", the text area grows vertically as the user types, up to a maximum height defined by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"design system (token "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sizeMaxHeightInput"},{"type":"text","text":"). Once that height is reached, the content becomes scrollable."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"constrainedMaxHeight"},{"text":" is set to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":", the maximum height is capped to the ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"minimum","type":"text"}]},{"text":" height","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(token ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sizeMinHeightInput"},{"text":"), keeping the component at a fixed, compact size at all times.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The content is immediately scrollable from the first overflow line.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This is useful in dense layouts — forms, filter panels, chat composers — where vertical space is at a premium.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["    \/\/ Height is fixed to the minimum (no vertical growth)","    OUDSTextArea(label: \"Comments\", text: $text, constrainedMaxHeight: true)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"Rich-text","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Rich text"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Rich text can be used for error and helper texts.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The helper text (","type":"text"},{"code":"HelperText.textual(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") and the error message (","type":"text"},{"code":"Status.textualError(message:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") are ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextualContent","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" values:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a raw "},{"code":"String","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (a string literal is enough), a localized string with ","type":"text"},{"code":".localized(_:tableName:bundle:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or a rich text with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".rich(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"and an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AttributedString"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Strong text can be used sparingly to highlight key information within the content.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"No other text styles should be used.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Underlined text must not be applied manually (e.g. in error message), as it is commonly associated with hyperlinks and may mislead users.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Code-samples","type":"heading","text":"Code samples","level":2},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ The text to display and edit","    @State var text: String = \"\"","","    \/\/ Empty text and no placeholder","    OUDSTextArea(label: \"Comments\", text: $text)","","    \/\/ Empty text with placeholder","    OUDSTextArea(label: \"Comments\", text: $text, placeholder: \"Describe your issue in detail\")","","    \/\/ With a helper text, raw, localized or rich","    OUDSTextArea(label: \"Comments\",","                 text: $text,","                 placeholder: \"Describe your issue in detail\",","                 helperText: .textual(\"Maximum 500 characters.\"))","    OUDSTextArea(label: \"Comments\", text: $text, helperText: .textual(.localized(\"comments_helper\", bundle: Bundle.module)))","    OUDSTextArea(label: \"Comments\",","                 text: $text,","                 helperText: .textual(.rich(AttributedString(markdown: \"Maximum **500** characters.\")))) \/\/ Manage in your side errors for init","","    \/\/ With a maximum character count — the component shows \"X characters remaining\" (bold)","    \/\/ and switches to an error style when exceeded.","    OUDSTextArea(label: \"Comments\",","                 text: $text,","                 helperText: .charactersMaxCount(500))","","    \/\/ With helper link","    @Environment(\\.openURL) private var openUrl","","    let helperLink = OUDSTextArea.Helperlink(text: \"Helper Link\") {","       openUrl.callAsFunction(url)","    }","","    OUDSTextArea(label: \"Comments\", text: $text, placeholder: \"Placeholder\", helperLink: helperLink)","","    \/\/ With error status","    OUDSTextArea(label: \"Comments\", text: $text, status: .textualError(message: \"This field can't be empty.\"))","","    \/\/ Outlined style","    OUDSTextArea(label: \"Comments\", text: $text, isOutlined: true)","","    \/\/ Fixed height — no vertical growth","    OUDSTextArea(label: \"Comments\", text: $text, constrainedMaxHeight: true)"]},{"anchor":"Design-documentation","type":"heading","text":"Design documentation","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-text-area"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Themes-rendering","type":"heading","text":"Themes rendering","level":2},{"anchor":"Orange","text":"Orange","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_textArea_Orange"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Orange-Compact","text":"Orange Compact","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_textArea_OrangeCompact"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Sosh","text":"Sosh","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_textArea_Sosh","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Wireframe","text":"Wireframe","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_textArea_Wireframe"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1.2.1 (Figma component design version)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Version","style":"note","type":"aside"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"1.4.0","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Since","style":"note","type":"aside"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudstextarea"]}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Structures","title":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextArea\/Helperlink"]},{"anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextArea\/init(_:tableName:bundle:text:placeholder:helperText:helperLink:isOutlined:constrainedMaxWidth:constrainedMaxHeight:status:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextArea\/init(label:text:placeholder:helperText:helperLink:isOutlined:constrainedMaxWidth:constrainedMaxHeight:status:)"],"generated":true,"title":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextArea\/body"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties","generated":true},{"title":"Enumerations","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextArea\/HelperText","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextArea\/Status"],"anchor":"Enumerations"},{"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextArea\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextArea\/View-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/docum